the woman with no window or name,"},{"s":24.08,"e":27.66,"text":"Only a number and a body in pain."},{"s":27.66,"e":30.9,"text":"Hear every soul behind concrete tonight,"},{"s":31.3,"e":34.36,"text":"Sleeping in darkness, starving for light."},{"s":34.36,"e":37.98,"text":"If it’s animal abuse to cage a creature that way,"},{"s":37.98,"e":41.6,"text":"Then don’t call it justice when humans decay."},{"s":41.6,"e":45.18,"text":"Send clean water, send bread, send air,"},{"s":45.18,"e":48.94,"text":"Send one honest witness who still dares to care."},{"s":48.94,"e":52.24,"text":"Send a doctor, send a lawyer, send a key,"},{"s":52.24,"e":56.26,"text":"Send mercy where mercy is hard to see."},{"s":56.26,"e":59.52,"text":"Break the loop, hold the dam,"},{"s":59.98,"e":63.2,"text":"Put your light in a trembling hand."},{"s":63.2,"e":66.62,"text":"Turn the asteroid into dust,"},{"s":67.14,"e":70.44,"text":"Save the ones the world won’t trust."},{"s":70.44,"e":73.78,"text":"Break the loop, clear the road,"},{"s":74.22,"e":77.28,"text":"Lift the prisoner’s heavy load."},{"s":77.8,"e":81.14,"text":"If there’s hell behind those bars,"},{"s":81.14,"e":84.66,"text":"Send Heaven through the iron scars."},{"s":84.66,"e":87.8,"text":"For the sick cell, for the crowded room,"},{"s":88.16,"e":91.38,"text":"For the brother breathing in a living tomb,"},{"s":91.74,"e":95.88,"text":"For the guilty judged, for the innocent freed,"},{"s":96.16,"e":99,"text":"For the human underneath the deed."},{"s":98.92,"e":102.04,"text":"No one should rot where the cameras don’t go,"},{"s":102.04,"e":105.68,"text":"No one should vanish where the records don’t show."},{"s":105.72,"e":109.62,"text":"Let the courts move faster than fear,"},{"s":109.62,"e":113.02,"text":"Let the world finally hear them clear."},{"s":113.02,"e":116.3,"text":"Send clean water, send bread, send air,"},{"s":116.3,"e":120.12,"text":"Send someone brave enough to stand right there."},{"s":120.12,"e":123.44,"text":"Send a hand through the wire and say,"},{"s":123.44,"e":127.78,"text":"“You are still a soul today.”"},{"s":127.78,"e":130.56,"text":"Break the loop, hold the dam,"},{"s":131.14,"e":134.26,"text":"Put your light in a trembling hand."},{"s":134.72,"e":137.72,"text":"Turn the asteroid into dust,"},{"s":137.86,"e":141.58,"text":"Save the ones the world won’t trust."},{"s":141.58,"e":144.8,"text":"Break the loop, clear the road,"},{"s":145.42,"e":148.68,"text":"Lift the prisoner’s heavy load."},{"s":148.68,"e":152.24,"text":"If there’s hell behind those bars,"},{"s":152.32,"e":155.78,"text":"Send Heaven through the iron scars."},{"s":156.28,"e":159.84,"text":"Hologram death scenes playing on repeat,"},{"s":159.84,"e":162.96,"text":"False little endings at the edge of sleep,"},{"s":162.96,"e":166.44,"text":"A voice says “jump,” but a higher voice says “stay,”"},{"s":166.44,"e":169.98,"text":"The nightmare is loud, but it fades away."},{"s":169.98,"e":174.08,"text":"The protagonist drives past the dam at night,"},{"s":174.08,"e":177.56,"text":"Sky split open by a burning light,"},{"s":177.56,"e":181.08,"text":"But God puts a hand where the impact lands—"},{"s":181.08,"e":185.28,"text":"No flood today, no blood on the sands."},{"s":185.28,"e":186.46,"text":"Break the loop."},{"s":187.36,"e":188.22,"text":"Hold the dam."},{"s":188.58,"e":190.08,"text":"Clear the road."},{"s":190.98,"e":191.9,"text":"Save the man."},{"s":192.16,"e":193.98,"text":"Break the loop."},{"s":194.4,"e":195.42,"text":"Hold the dam."},{"s":195.72,"e":197.14,"text":"Feed the cell."},{"s":198.24,"e":198.88,"text":"Free the lamb."},{"s":198.86,"e":201.66,"text":"Break the loop, hold the dam,"},{"s":202.24,"e":205.98,"text":"Put your light in a trembling hand."},{"s":205.98,"e":209.12,"text":"Turn the asteroid into dust,"},{"s":209.12,"e":213.08,"text":"Save the ones the world won’t trust."},{"s":213.08,"e":216.04,"text":"Break the loop, clear the road,"},{"s":216.48,"e":219.56,"text":"Lift the prisoner’s heavy load."},{"s":220.04,"e":223.36,"text":"If there’s hell behind those bars,"},{"s":223.36,"e":226.78,"text":"Send Heaven through the iron scars."},{"s":226.78,"e":230.04,"text":"God of the locked room, God of the key,"},{"s":230.22,"e":233.56,"text":"God of the ones we refuse to see,"},{"s":233.62,"e":237.6,"text":"Walk through the prison, whisper their names—"},{"s":237.64,"e":242,"text":"No soul is only its chains"}],"duration":259.08,"source":"whisper-aligned","generatedAt":"2026-08-29T02:49:44.428Z","stats":{"whisperWords":470,"polishedWords":462,"matched":451,"matchRate":0.976}}